@ClaimFlow.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5252

### Log in as the seeded admin
POST {{ClaimFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@claimflow.dev",
  "password": "Admin#12345"
}

### List policies (replace {{token}} with the token from the login response)
GET {{ClaimFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/policies?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### File a claim against a seeded policy
POST {{ClaimFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyNumber": "POL-AUTO-0001",
  "incidentDate": "2026-05-01",
  "description": "Rear-ended at a red light on Main St.",
  "claimedAmount": 2500
}

### List claims
GET {{ClaimFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/claims?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
